{"kind":"assert","text":"OB-L credentials, mechanism only. The analytics read token is a bare token in the operator file ~/.config/generalbusiness/cloudflare_analytics_read.env, the file that scripts/do-rate.mjs --token-file reads. In the scratch command, set DAP_ANALYTICS_READ_TOKEN=\"$(cat \u003cthat file\u003e)\" inside the command's own environment. Never echo it, log it or write it into evidence. The account ID is the hostname prefix of the artifacts host in ARTIFACTS_CONFIG in apps/room/wrangler.demo.jsonc. That value is already public in the repository. Set CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID from it the same way. Before you retain the output files, check that neither the token nor the Authorization header appears in them.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}